---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - UW Economics Society">
  <Nav />
  <main class="section-light">
    <section class="about-page">
      <div class="about-page-inner">
        <h1 class="page-title">About Us</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Who we are and what we do</p>

        <div class="about-content">
            <p>
                Are you a University of Waterloo Economics student? Looking for ways to connect with your peers and department outside of the classroom? The Economics Society is the perfect way to get involved!
                The UWES executive team is a unique opportunity to gain leadership experience while studying, and working with like-minded students to facilitate academic and social events for the student body.
            </p>
            <p>
                Within the Faculty of Arts lie many subjects, the majority of which have their own societies which interact with the Arts Student Union (ASU).
                UWES is a student society dedicated to Economics majors! Our mandate as a student society is to provide economics students with the infrastructure and tools for collaborative engagement, support and learning.
                We aim to provide social and academic events throughout the year that contribute to the student experience and promote networking and learning opportunities.
            </p>
            <p>
                If you have any questions about the society or have any feedback you would like to share, please reach out to us at: <a class="email-highlight" href="mailto:uw.economics.society@gmail.com">uw.economics.society@gmail.com</a>
            </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .about-page-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-content p {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .email-highlight {
    background-color: var(--color-card-border);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>
